2.3 KUBERNETES - SCENARIO
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[QUESTION]
Deploy Version 1, perform rolling update to Version 2, deploy defective version, and rollback.

[FILE: nptel.yaml]
```yaml
apiVersion: apps/v1
kind: Deployment
metadata:
  name: nptel-app
spec:
  replicas: 3
  strategy:
    type: RollingUpdate
    rollingUpdate:
      maxSurge: 1
      maxUnavailable: 0
  selector:
    matchLabels:
      app: nptel
  template:
    metadata:
      labels:
        app: nptel
    spec:
      containers:
        - name: app
          image: nginx:alpine
          ports:
            - containerPort: 80
          resources:
            requests:
              cpu: 50m
          readinessProbe:
            httpGet:
              path: /
              port: 80
---
apiVersion: v1
kind: Service
metadata:
  name: nptel-svc
spec:
  selector:
    app: nptel
  ports:
    - port: 80
```

[RUN COMMANDS]
# 1. Deploy V1
kubectl apply -f nptel.yaml

# 2. Rolling update to V2
kubectl set image deployment/nptel-app app=httpd:alpine

# 3. Defective update (bad image)
kubectl set image deployment/nptel-app app=nginx:invalid-tag
kubectl rollout status deployment/nptel-app

# 4. Rollback
kubectl rollout undo deployment/nptel-app


