[QUESTION]
Docker Compose running a web application with a Redis database backend (simplest page counter).

[FILE: app.js]
```javascript
const express = require('express');
const redis = require('redis');
const app = express();
const client = redis.createClient({ host: 'redis' });

app.get('/', (req, res) => {
  client.incr('counter', (err, count) => res.send('Views: ' + count));
});

app.listen(3000);
```

